english translation text:
I hear that your chest lies within the range of the spears;
I can see nothing—towards which direction should I go?
Call out to me, O light of my eyes, so I may reach you;
give your aged father a sign, Akbar.

With each broken breath, fresh blood rises from your mouth;
the spearhead trembles within your young chest.
With your death, your father's life is leaving him;
do not surrender your life before your aged father, Akbar.

A letter from your sister has only just arrived from Madina;
stay a little longer, for God's sake, and support your father.
This spear must still be removed from your chest;
endure this trial in God's path, Akbar.
